@dev
on-arrival: {!
var r = function(x) { return Math.round(x*10)/10; };
Q.dv_trust = r(Q.comintern_trust);
Q.dv_bal = r(Q.moscow_balance);
Q.dv_mult = Math.round(Q.campaign_mult*1000)/1000;
Q.dv_kfd = r(Q.kf_dissent_percent);
Q.dv_lr = Q.time - Q.adv_right_last; Q.dv_lc = Q.time - Q.adv_centre_last; Q.dv_ll = Q.time - Q.adv_left_last;
Q.dv_rs = r(Q.kf_right_strength); Q.dv_rd = r(Q.kf_right_dissent);
Q.dv_ls = r(Q.kf_left_strength); Q.dv_ld = r(Q.kf_left_dissent);
Q.dv_cs = r(Q.kf_centre_strength); Q.dv_cd = r(Q.kf_centre_dissent);
Q.dv_tiermult = Q.moscow_tier >= 4 ? 0.8 : (Q.moscow_tier >= 3 ? 0.9 : 1);
Q.dv_ban = Q.kpd_banned ? 0.5 : 1;
Q.dv_zig = Math.round((1 - 0.04*Q.zigzag)*100)/100;
Q.dv_wk = r(Q.workers_kpd); Q.dv_uk = r(Q.unemployed_kpd); Q.dv_ok = r(Q.old_middle_kpd);
Q.dv_nk = r(Q.new_middle_kpd); Q.dv_rk = r(Q.rural_kpd); Q.dv_ck = r(Q.catholics_kpd);
Q.dv_ws = r(Q.workers_spd); Q.dv_us = r(Q.unemployed_spd);
Q.dv_rfb = r(Q.rfb_strength);
Q.dv_pr = r(Q.pro_republic); Q.dv_nat = r(Q.nationalism); Q.dv_soc = r(Q.socialism);
Q.dv_districts = Object.keys(window.KPD.DISTRICTS).map(function(d) { return d + ' ' + r(Q['d_' + d + '_org']) + '/' + r(Q['d_' + d + '_pres']) + '/' + Q['d_' + d + '_h']; }).join(', ');
Q.dv_kpd_v = r(Q.kpd_votes); Q.dv_spd_v = r(Q.spd_votes);
!}

= Dev numbers

Month [+ month +] [+ year +], time [+ time +]. Resources [+ resources +], dues [+ dues +], actions this month [+ month_actions +].

**Campaign multiplier m = [+ dv_mult +]** = (1 - faction dissent [+ dv_kfd +]%) x zigzag factor [+ dv_zig +] (zigzag [+ zigzag +]) x ban factor [+ dv_ban +] x Moscow tier factor [+ dv_tiermult +]. In choice effects, "x m" means multiplied by this.

**Factions** (strength / dissent)

Right [+ dv_rs +] / [+ dv_rd +]. Left [+ dv_ls +] / [+ dv_ld +]. Centre [+ dv_cs +] / [+ dv_cd +]. Party line: [+ party_line +], [+ party_line_months +] months. Head of party buff: ×[+ head_mult +]. Months since adviser card used: Right [+ dv_lr +], Centre [+ dv_lc +], Left [+ dv_ll +]. Demand cooldowns (months): Right [+ demand_right_timer +], Centre [+ demand_centre_timer +], Left [+ demand_left_timer +].

**Moscow**

Trust [+ dv_trust +] (tier [+ moscow_tier +]; under 50 letter, 40 subsidy cut, 30 open letter, 15 emissaries). Balance [+ dv_bal +], drift [+ moscow_drift +] a month. Leader [+ moscow_leader +], favours [+ moscow_favored +]. Subsidy [+ soviet_subsidy +] (granted [+ subsidy_granted +]). Delegation cooldown [+ moscow_action_timer +].

**Districts** (organisation / pressure / Hundreds)

[+ dv_districts +]

Workers' mood [+ mood +]. Dues income [+ dues_income +] a month. Directive [+ dir_idx +], record [+ dir_record +]. October ok [+ oct_ok +]. Zeigner [+ zeigner +].

**1923 counters**

Joint actions with the SPD left (unity) [+ y23_unity +]. Hundreds [+ y23_hundreds +], strength [+ dv_rfb +]. Strikes [+ y23_strikes +]. Saxony [+ y23_saxony +], Thuringia [+ y23_thuringia +]. Banned [+ kpd_banned +]. Outcome [+ y23_outcome +]. October failed [+ y23_failed +].

**Cooldowns (months left)**

Advisers: Brandler [+ brandler_timer +], Thalheimer [+ thalheimer_timer +], Walcher [+ walcher_timer +], Radek [+ radek_timer +], Pieck [+ pieck_timer +], Meyer [+ meyer_timer +], Zetkin [+ zetkin_timer +], Eberlein [+ eberlein_timer +], Fischer [+ fischer_timer +], Maslow [+ maslow_timer +], Thälmann [+ thaelmann_timer +].

Fundraising [+ fundraising_timer +]. Line action [+ line_action_timer +]. Leadership [+ shuffle_leadership_timer +]. Strikes card [+ mass_strikes_timer +]. Defence [+ mass_defence_timer +]. Unemployed [+ mass_unemployed_timer +]. Parliament [+ mass_parliament_timer +]. Press [+ mass_press_timer +]. Relief [+ mass_relief_timer +].

**KPD support within each class (percent of class votes)**

Workers [+ dv_wk +] (SPD [+ dv_ws +]). Unemployed [+ dv_uk +] (SPD [+ dv_us +]). Rural [+ dv_rk +]. New middle [+ dv_nk +]. Old middle [+ dv_ok +]. Catholics [+ dv_ck +].

**Overall**

KPD [+ dv_kpd_v +]% and SPD [+ dv_spd_v +]% of the vote if an election were held now. Pro-republic [+ dv_pr +], nationalism [+ dv_nat +], socialism [+ dv_soc +].

